    const registryOverview=`<section class="panel paper-registry-overview" id="paper-registry-overview"><div class="idea-panel-heading"><div><div class="eyebrow">PaperRegistry · ${pick("论文输出总账","PAPER OUTPUT LEDGER")}</div><h2 data-toc="false">${pick(`${registrySummary.papers||registryPapers.length} 篇论文已经进入 PaperState；真正 Submission Ready=${registrySummary.submission_ready||0}`,`${registrySummary.papers||registryPapers.length} papers are in PaperState; truly Submission Ready=${registrySummary.submission_ready||0}`)}</h2><p class="section-intro">${pick("科研证据充分与投稿流程完成是两件事。PaperRegistry 直接读取 append-only Paper Acceptance Ledger：STRI 与边界冻结的 Agent Safety R9 论文现在都已达到 READY / SUBMISSION_READY。Agent Safety 的同 schedule no-update 对照已关闭原先的论文因果证据 HOLD；更宽的 G-1 复现/支持研究线仍保持 HOLD。这里的论文工作流没有科学、实验、GPU 或自动投稿权限，真实 SUBMITTED 仍需外部人工提交。","Scientific evidence sufficiency and submission-process completion are separate. PaperRegistry reads the append-only Paper Acceptance Ledger directly: both STRI and the bounded Agent Safety R9 paper are now READY / SUBMISSION_READY. Agent Safety's same-schedule no-update control closed the paper's recorded causal evidence hold, while the broader G-1 replication/support research program remains HOLD. The paper workflow has no scientific, experiment, GPU, or automatic submission authority, and real SUBMITTED still requires external human action.")}</p></div><strong>${registrySummary.submission_ready||0}<span>${pick("真正投稿就绪","truly submission-ready")}</span></strong></div><div class="paper-registry-grid">${registryCards}</div></section>`;
